# Exclude large directories that must never enter the Docker build context.
# Keep service source dirs — the build stage uses them for `next build`.

.git
.claude
.firecrawl
.superpowers
.vscode

# Root-level node_modules (hoisted deps are re-created inside the image)
node_modules

# Per-package node_modules (re-created inside the image)
**/node_modules

# Next.js build artifacts
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/coverage

# eve build artifacts — `eve build` regenerates .output inside the image, and .eve/builds/
# keeps a ~10 MB copy of every local build. Both are gitignored; without them here a local
# `eve build` would ship its stale output into the image too.
**/.output
**/.eve

# Logs / OS noise
**/*.log
.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
